        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Functions can be rebuilt as infinite polynomials, exact within an interval of convergence — the capstone of the course.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "The amber Maclaurin polynomial for \\( \\sin x \\) hugs the true curve (indigo) ever more widely as you add terms.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
